notes               = "Untitled in source. Three lines. سُو سُو زدن is the verb for a light that flickers or gutters — the smallest possible light, and it is enough. Bare year ۱۳۸۲ → +621 = 2003. Imported as a draft with machine / lantern layers; ===translation=== left for Ben."
draft               = true

===persian===

شوقِ ستاره‌ای که...
سُو... سُو می‌زند...
مرا از تاریکی می‌رهاند...
۱۳۸۲

===machine===

The longing of a star that...
flickers... flickers...
delivers me out of the darkness...
1382

===lantern===

The longing of a star
that flickers, flickers,
delivers me out of the darkness...

1382

